  "type": "multipleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math> be the following straight lines.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math><br />Suppose the straight line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mi>l</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> lies in the plane containing <math><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>, and passes through the point of intersection of <math><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>. If the line <math><mi>L</mi></math> bisects the acute angle between the lines <math><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></math>, then which of the following statements is/are TRUE?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "rmm6u",
      "text": "<math><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jkfhP",
      "text": "<math><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "9ISUo",
      "text": "<math><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lurko",
      "text": "<math><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
